{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111194355765-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111201539\"/><p>事主被發現於曉麗苑的住所內暈倒。</p><p>今午(11日)4時08分，執法部門接獲一名男子報案，指其姓李(43歲)妻子在秀茂坪曉光街21號曉麗苑的住所房間床上暈倒。救援人員接報到場，將陷入昏迷的李婦送往聯合醫院搶救，惟她其後被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:58:20.670439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:43:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:52:27.588124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:51:42.276407+00:00","content_hash":"4c334a03dbc4a02c5651e1104e5c5cdcc63455b60baf632c706bc27e97d9d663","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:58:20.670439+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}